Package: adaptagrams
Type: Package
Title: Adaptagrams Layout and Routing for 'igraph'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adaptagrams", "Bindings", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainers@example.invalid")
Description: Native object-avoiding connector routing and constraint-based
    graph layout using the Adaptagrams C++ libraries. Native 'igraph' graph
    objects are accepted and returned without changing topology or unrelated
    attributes.
